                        "entry_id": "ea2ec92c-bbbe-30ab-89cf-e26b92dd7b65",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The son of Aphrodite and Dionysus, god of procreation, and guardian of gardens and vineyards; personification of the phallus."
                        ],
